  <p class="kicker">Services & third-party administration</p>
  <h1>The strategy matters. So does every detail after it.</h1>
  <p class="lede">Sterling Pension Group brings plan design, administration, and professional coordination into one clearer experience for business owners and their advisors.</p>
  <div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn primary" href="/contact">Talk through your current plan</a></div>
